    "help.businessFeatures.intro": "Business and Enterprise accounts extend ZRP from a social network into a professional communication and publishing platform.",
    "help.businessFeatures.f1Title": "Article Publishing",
    "help.businessFeatures.f1Desc": "Publish long-form content with rich media for thought leadership, company updates, research, and industry analysis.",
